{"id":"9e7559e5bc3868e1","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-pcp.md","title":"thm-pcp (PCP Theorem)","display":"thm-pcp (PCP Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-pcp]]"],"display":"thm-pcp (PCP Theorem)","label":"28-thm-pcp","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-pcp","PCP Theorem","NP = PCP(O(log n), O(1))"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 11.5; §22.2","source_printed_pages":"241,461–463","source_pdf_pages":"267,487–489","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a632dcea280a149\" href=\"?note=7a632dcea280a149\" title=\"28-df-pcp\">28-df-pcp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pcp (PCP Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-pcp"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-pcp</span><span>PCP Theorem</span><span>NP = PCP(O(log n), O(1))</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 11.5; §22.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"241,461–463"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"267,487–489"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PCP}[r,q]\">\\(\\mathbf{PCP}[r,q]\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a632dcea280a149\" href=\"?note=7a632dcea280a149\" title=\"28-df-pcp\">28-df-pcp</a> 的非适应查询、完整性一、可靠性二分之一约定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_a(n)\\coloneqq a\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil,\\qquad q_b(n)\\coloneqq b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_a(n)\\coloneqq a\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil,\\qquad q_b(n)\\coloneqq b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}=\\bigcup_{a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{PCP}[r_a,q_b].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NP}=\\bigcup_{a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{PCP}[r_a,q_b].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>此并集就是书中的 PCP(O(log n),O(1))。容易方向通过猜测所有可访问证明位并穷举随机带验证；困难方向的证明在第22章。已对照陈述与 §11.3 两种视角转换，但未逐项核验第22章所有 gap-amplification 和 alphabet-reduction 引理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.5; §22.2，印刷页 241,461–463；PDF 页 267,487–489。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R6证据边界：第22章间隙放大及字母表约减证明链尚未完整核验。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pcp","status":"resolved","id":"7a632dcea280a149","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pcp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]；$\\mathbf{PCP}[r,q]$ 采用 [[28-df-pcp]] 的非适应查询、完整性一、可靠性二分之一约定。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pcp","status":"resolved","id":"7a632dcea280a149","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]；$\\mathbf{PCP}[r,q]$ 采用 [[28-df-pcp]] 的非适应查询、完整性一、可靠性二分之一约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PCP}[r,q]","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"r_a(n)\\coloneqq a\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil,\\qquad q_b(n)\\coloneqq b.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}=\\bigcup_{a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{PCP}[r_a,q_b].","display":true}],"bytes":1607,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"PCP：[[28-df-pcp]]、[[28-thm-pcp]]、[[28-df-gap-problem]]、[[28-df-max-3sat]]、[[28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness]]。"},{"id":"a6ab1076181efd97","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0cb5248561455df8","7a632dcea280a149"]}